  "title": "Creamy Macaroni Salad",
  "description": "This recipe for creamy pasta salad features tender macaroni pasta tossed in a creamy, seasoned sauce made with mayonnaise, sour cream, and evaporated milk.",
  "authors": [
    "Mandy Franke"
  ],
